{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", our|strong=\"H5921\"Lord, how majestic is|strong=\"H1732\"your|strong=\"H5921\"name in|strong=\"H5921\"all|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"earth!  \nYou|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H5921\"set your|strong=\"H5921\"glory above|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"heavens!   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"From|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H3605\"lips of|strong=\"H3068\"babes and|strong=\"H3068\"infants you|strong=\"H5414\"have|strong=\"H3068\"established|strong=\"H5414\"strength,  \nbecause|strong=\"H5921\"of|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"adversaries, that|strong=\"H3605\"you|strong=\"H5414\"might|strong=\"H3068\"silence the|strong=\"H3605\"enemy and|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"avenger.   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"When|strong=\"H6310\"I consider your|strong=\"H5797\"heavens, the|strong=\"H3245\"work|strong=\"H3245\"of|strong=\"H6310\"your|strong=\"H5797\"fingers,  \nthe|strong=\"H3245\"moon and|strong=\"H6310\"the|strong=\"H3245\"stars, which|strong=\"H3245\"you|strong=\"H6310\"have|strong=\"H6887\"ordained|strong=\"H3245\",   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"what|strong=\"H4639\"is|strong=\"H4639\"man|strong=\"H7200\", that|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"think|strong=\"H7200\"of|strong=\"H4639\"him|strong=\"H7200\"?  \nWhat|strong=\"H4639\"is|strong=\"H4639\"the|strong=\"H7200\"son of|strong=\"H4639\"man|strong=\"H7200\", that|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"care for|strong=\"H3588\"him|strong=\"H7200\"?   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H1121\"made|strong=\"H6485\"him|strong=\"H6485\"a|strong=\"H3068\"little lower than|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"angels,  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"crowned him|strong=\"H6485\"with|strong=\"H6485\"glory and|strong=\"H1121\"honor.   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"You|strong=\"H1926\"make him|strong=\"H5849\"ruler over the|strong=\"H3519\"works of|strong=\"H3519\"your hands.  \nYou|strong=\"H1926\"have|strong=\"H4592\"put all|strong=\"H2637\"things under his|strong=\"H1926\"feet:   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"All|strong=\"H3605\"sheep and|strong=\"H3027\"cattle,  \nyes, and|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H3605\"animals of|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H3605\"field,   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"the|strong=\"H3605\"birds of|strong=\"H7704\"the|strong=\"H3605\"sky, the|strong=\"H3605\"fish of|strong=\"H7704\"the|strong=\"H3605\"sea,  \nand|strong=\"H7704\"whatever|strong=\"H3605\"passes through|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"paths of|strong=\"H7704\"the|strong=\"H3605\"seas.   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", our|strong=\"H5674\"Lord,  \nhow majestic is your|strong=\"H5674\"name in|strong=\"H3220\"all|strong=\"H5674\"the|strong=\"H5674\"earth|strong=\"H8064\"!   \n"}]}
